From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:51:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] DVDInputStreamBluray: poll the disc program without reading

In navigation mode libbluray runs the HDMV program, menu animations and
queued app events only inside a read. A player that does not read leaves
a menu action unseen until its next read. A zero-length read runs them
without reading data.
---
 .../DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.cpp  | 108 ++++++++++++++++--
 .../DVDInputStreams/DVDInputStreamBluray.h    |  12 ++
 2 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

